      "title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"97e2c3e5582b018e\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nMechanism of hypokalemia in magnesium deficiency - PubMed\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"97e2c3e5582b018e\">>>",
