      "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"24ac5e816269f07e\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nMagnesium deficiency is frequently associated with hypokalemia. Concomitant magnesium deficiency aggravates hypokalemia and renders it refractory to treatment by potassium. Herein is reviewed literature suggesting that magnesium deficiency exacerbates potassium wasting by increasing distal ...\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"24ac5e816269f07e\">>>",
