      "title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"a9f1fd417ebe4b61\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nThe Effects of Magnesium Coadminstration During Treatment of Hypokalemia in the Emergency Department - ScienceDirect\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"a9f1fd417ebe4b61\">>>",
      "url": "https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/abs/pii/S073646792200347X",
      "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"15fb5cffaa758bb4\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nWe observed that <strong>magnesium coadministration did not improve time to serum potassium normalization</strong>, frequency of normalization within 24 h of treatment initiation, or magnitude of serum potassium elevation after unadjusted and adjusted analyses.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"15fb5cffaa758bb4\">>>",
